@*  Per-screen user manual for INJ-002 Dashboard.
    Layout: a scaled SVG schematic of the INJ-002 screen on the left,
    numbered callouts ①–⑥ pointing at every region, and a bilingual
    KO/EN step list on the right that explains what each numbered
    region does and how the operator interacts with it. *@

<div class="help-doc">
    @* ── SVG schematic ──────────────────────────────────────── *@
    <div>
        <div class="help-h1">INJ-002 · DASHBOARD</div>
        <div class="help-sub">사출 라인 실시간 대시보드 · Live Injection-Line Dashboard</div>

        <svg class="help-svg" viewBox="0 0 720 480" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
            @* Outer frame *@
            <rect x="6" y="6" width="708" height="468" rx="10"
                  fill="#000" stroke="rgba(255,255,255,.18)" stroke-width="1.5" />

            @* ① Top bar *@
            <rect class="hs-region tbar" x="14" y="14" width="692" height="48" />
            <text class="hs-label" x="34" y="44">A-MES</text>
            <text class="hs-sub"   x="100" y="44">INJ-002 · STATION · LINE</text>
            <text class="hs-sub"   x="560" y="44" text-anchor="end">EMP · SHIFT · CLOCK</text>
            <circle class="hs-num" cx="640" cy="38" r="14" />
            <text  class="hs-num-tx" x="640" y="38">1</text>

            @* ② WO Progress card *@
            <rect class="hs-region ok" x="14" y="76" width="410" height="120" />
            <text class="hs-sub"   x="28" y="96">WO PROGRESS</text>
            <text class="hs-label" x="28" y="138" style="font-size:32px;">182</text>
            <text class="hs-sub"   x="120" y="138">/ 384 EA</text>
            <text class="hs-label" x="380" y="138" style="font-size:24px;" text-anchor="end">47%</text>
            <rect x="28" y="150" width="380" height="10" rx="5" fill="rgba(255,255,255,.1)" />
            <rect x="28" y="150" width="180" height="10" rx="5" fill="#22c55e" />
            <text class="hs-sub"   x="28" y="182">D-DAY  ·  CYCLE  ·  ROUTING  ·  NEXT</text>
            <circle class="hs-num" cx="38" cy="86" r="14" />
            <text  class="hs-num-tx" x="38" y="86">2</text>

            @* ③ Equipment Status *@
            <rect class="hs-region warn" x="436" y="76" width="270" height="120" />
            <text class="hs-sub"   x="448" y="96">EQUIPMENT</text>
            <circle cx="500" cy="140" r="14" fill="#22c55e" />
            <text class="hs-label" x="528" y="146" style="font-size:18px;">RUN</text>
            <text class="hs-sub"   x="528" y="166">Uptime 02:14:33</text>
            <circle class="hs-num" cx="448" cy="86" r="14" />
            <text  class="hs-num-tx" x="448" y="86">3</text>

            @* ④ Three gauges *@
            <rect class="hs-region" x="14"  y="210" width="226" height="86" />
            <text class="hs-label" x="40"  y="252" style="font-size:24px;" fill="#86efac">2.1%</text>
            <text class="hs-sub"   x="40"  y="276">DEFECT RATE</text>

            <rect class="hs-region" x="248" y="210" width="226" height="86" />
            <text class="hs-label" x="274" y="252" style="font-size:24px;" fill="#fbbf24">38%</text>
            <text class="hs-sub"   x="274" y="276">MOLD SHOTS</text>

            <rect class="hs-region dim" x="482" y="210" width="224" height="86" />
            <text class="hs-label" x="508" y="252" style="font-size:24px;" fill="rgba(255,255,255,.4)">—</text>
            <text class="hs-sub"   x="508" y="276">OEE (todo)</text>
            <circle class="hs-num" cx="24" cy="220" r="14" />
            <text  class="hs-num-tx" x="24" y="220">4</text>

            @* ⑤ Hourly bars *@
            <rect class="hs-region" x="14" y="310" width="692" height="106" />
            <text class="hs-sub"   x="28" y="328">HOURLY OUTPUT  ·  TARGET 18/h</text>
            @{
                var heights = new[] { 40,55,60,72,75,80,72,65,55,42,30,20 };
                var cx = 38;
            }
            @for (var i = 0; i < heights.Length; i++)
            {
                var h = heights[i];
                var cls = i == 6 ? "#fbbf24" : i > 6 ? "rgba(255,255,255,.18)" : "#22c55e";
                var hour = (6 + i).ToString("00");
                <g>
                    <rect x="@(cx + i * 56)" y="@(404 - h)" width="40" height="@h" rx="2" fill="@cls" />
                    <text class="hs-sub" x="@(cx + i * 56 + 20)" y="424" text-anchor="middle">@hour</text>
                </g>
            }
            <circle class="hs-num" cx="24" cy="320" r="14" />
            <text  class="hs-num-tx" x="24" y="320">5</text>

            @* ⑥ Nav bar *@
            <rect class="hs-region nav" x="14" y="430" width="692" height="38" />
            @for (var i = 0; i < 7; i++)
            {
                var fill = i == 1 ? "rgba(37,99,235,.55)" : i == 2 ? "rgba(251,191,36,.4)"
                         : i == 5 ? "rgba(220,38,38,.5)"  : "rgba(255,255,255,.06)";
                var label = "INJ-0" + (i + 3);
                <g>
                    <rect x="@(20 + i * 98)" y="436" width="90" height="26" rx="4" fill="@fill"
                          stroke="rgba(255,255,255,.18)" stroke-width="1" />
                    <text class="hs-sub" x="@(20 + i * 98 + 45)" y="452" text-anchor="middle"
                          style="font-size:9px;">@label</text>
                </g>
            }
            <circle class="hs-num" cx="24" cy="440" r="14" />
            <text  class="hs-num-tx" x="24" y="440">6</text>
        </svg>

        <div class="help-callout info">
            <div class="help-callout-i">💡</div>
            <div class="help-callout-tx">
                <strong>Auto-refresh every 5 seconds.</strong> No need to reload — the page polls the database in the background.<br/>
                <span style="color:rgba(255,255,255,.55);">5초마다 자동 갱신됩니다. 새로고침할 필요 없습니다.</span>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    @* ── Step list ─────────────────────────────────────────── *@
    <div>
        <div class="help-section-h">▶ READ THE SCREEN · 화면 읽기</div>
        <div class="help-steps">

            <div class="help-step">
                <div class="help-step-num">1</div>
                <div class="help-step-body">
                    <div class="help-step-en">Top bar shows your station ID, line ID, your name + shift, and a live clock.</div>
                    <div class="help-step-ko">상단 바에 단말기 ID · 라인 ID · 작업자명 · 교대 · 시계가 표시됩니다.</div>
                    <div class="help-step-hint">⛯ green = online · grey = offline</div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="help-step ok">
                <div class="help-step-num">2</div>
                <div class="help-step-body">
                    <div class="help-step-en">Active Work-Order progress. Big number = completed qty. Bar + % = progress. Bottom row: D-Day, cycle time, routing path, next stop.</div>
                    <div class="help-step-ko">현재 진행 중인 WO의 누적 생산량 · 진행률 · D-Day · 사이클타임 · 라우팅 · 다음 공정.</div>
                    <div class="help-step-hint">D-Day ≤ 1 → text turns yellow (urgent)</div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="help-step warn">
                <div class="help-step-num">3</div>
                <div class="help-step-body">
                    <div class="help-step-en">Equipment status LED. Green RUN = producing. Yellow IDLE = standby. Red STOP = halted. Grey = offline.</div>
                    <div class="help-step-ko">설비 LED 색: 초록 RUN · 노랑 IDLE · 빨강 STOP · 회색 OFFLINE.</div>
                    <div class="help-step-hint">If LED is red, check INJ-008 ANDON</div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="help-step">
                <div class="help-step-num">4</div>
                <div class="help-step-body">
                    <div class="help-step-en">Three gauges. Defect Rate ≥ 5% goes red — pause and inspect. Mold Shots shows current/rated count.</div>
                    <div class="help-step-ko">3개 게이지: 불량률(≥5% 빨강 경고) · 금형 샷 카운트 · OEE(추후).</div>
                    <div class="help-step-hint">Tap ④ no action — it's read-only</div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="help-step ok">
                <div class="help-step-num">5</div>
                <div class="help-step-body">
                    <div class="help-step-en">Hourly output bars 06h–17h. Yellow = current hour. Hollow = future hours (target line).</div>
                    <div class="help-step-ko">시간별 생산량 막대. 노랑 = 현재 시간 · 빈 막대 = 향후 시간(목표).</div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="help-step dim">
                <div class="help-step-num">6</div>
                <div class="help-step-body">
                    <div class="help-step-en">Bottom nav — 7 buttons to the other INJ screens + LOGOUT (rightmost).</div>
                    <div class="help-step-ko">하단 내비게이션 — INJ-003~08로 이동, 맨 우측은 로그아웃.</div>
                    <div class="help-step-hint">INJ-004 Production · INJ-005 Defect · INJ-008 Andon are most-used</div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="help-section-h">▶ COMMON TASKS · 자주 쓰는 작업</div>
        <div class="help-steps">

            <div class="help-step">
                <div class="help-step-num">A</div>
                <div class="help-step-body">
                    <div class="help-step-en"><strong>Log a finished cycle</strong> — press <kbd>INJ-004 Prod Entry</kbd> in the bottom nav.</div>
                    <div class="help-step-ko"><strong>사이클 완료 기록</strong> — 하단 INJ-004 버튼.</div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="help-step bad">
                <div class="help-step-num">B</div>
                <div class="help-step-body">
                    <div class="help-step-en"><strong>Record a defect</strong> — <kbd>INJ-005 Defect</kbd>. Pick the defect code card and qty.</div>
                    <div class="help-step-ko"><strong>불량 등록</strong> — INJ-005 진입 → 불량 코드 카드 선택 → 수량 입력.</div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="help-step warn">
                <div class="help-step-num">C</div>
                <div class="help-step-body">
                    <div class="help-step-en"><strong>Raise an Andon call</strong> — <kbd>🚨 INJ-008 Andon</kbd> when the line stops or quality drops.</div>
                    <div class="help-step-ko"><strong>안돈 호출</strong> — 라인 정지 또는 품질 이상 시 INJ-008.</div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="help-step dim">
                <div class="help-step-num">D</div>
                <div class="help-step-body">
                    <div class="help-step-en"><strong>Hand-off to next shift</strong> — press <kbd>LOGOUT</kbd>. The next operator scans their badge on INJ-001.</div>
                    <div class="help-step-ko"><strong>교대 인수인계</strong> — 로그아웃 후 다음 작업자가 INJ-01에서 배지 스캔.</div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="help-callout warn">
            <div class="help-callout-i">⚠</div>
            <div class="help-callout-tx">
                <strong>If "—" appears in any field</strong>, it means the linked master data isn't seeded yet (e.g. mold, recipe). Production can still proceed but check with the shift leader.<br/>
                <span style="color:rgba(255,255,255,.55);">"—" 표시는 연결된 마스터 데이터(금형/레시피)가 누락된 상태입니다. 생산은 가능하지만 반장에게 확인 바랍니다.</span>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
